      "id": 262486,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2025-02-18T19:54:51.286Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Aw man, no shared love letters? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=12\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>YES so thankful for Christopher making that reference. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Clearly, we don’t hear enough about Dana on the podcast, because hearing that she’s a very important character in the comics strikes me oddly.</p>\n<p>Every time they say “Young Iron Legacy”, I think Exile.</p>\n<p>Harpy/Alpha? Yeah, I can see that, or at least why it is appealing.</p>\n<p>Non-glue soglutions? Blasphemy!</p>\n<p>Hooray for inanity!</p>\n<p>Sk8blayd mentioned <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/eyes.png?v=12\" title=\":eyes:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":eyes:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Absolute Zero is who the metaverse uses in Spider-Man and Elsa videos.</p>\n<p>I love how calling men “a sometimes food” for a vampire takes on a different connotation.</p>\n<p>Imagine asking a question about villain couples, invoking the Citizens of the Sun, and then not naming Assault and Battery.</p>\n<p>I dearly want a non-Tempest episode about a hero being written poorly now. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Oh my god, there’s so many letters!</p>\n<p>Oooh, what proof of the Wraith’s identity is sitting, untouched, on someone’s desk? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>It’s called <em>Cosmic</em> Contest, of course it counts for space!</p>\n<p>Can’t wait for the Dawn of Ra storyline to pop up.</p>\n<p><em>Who</em> could record Setback’s luck? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Glamour? The Entertainer??</p>\n<p>I’m glad there won’t be any more expansions, that would just be overwhelming to comprehend! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2025-02-18T19:54:51.286Z",
