      "raw": "Aw man, no shared love letters? :(\n\nYES so thankful for Christopher making that reference. :D\n\nClearly, we don't hear enough about Dana on the podcast, because hearing that she's a very important character in the comics strikes me oddly.\n\nEvery time they say \"Young Iron Legacy\", I think Exile.\n\nHarpy/Alpha? Yeah, I can see that, or at least why it is appealing.\n\nNon-glue soglutions? Blasphemy!\n\nHooray for inanity!\n\nSk8blayd mentioned :eyes:\n\nAbsolute Zero is who the metaverse uses in Spider-Man and Elsa videos.\n\nI love how calling men \"a sometimes food\" for a vampire takes on a different connotation.\n\nImagine asking a question about villain couples, invoking the Citizens of the Sun, and then not naming Assault and Battery.\n\nI dearly want a non-Tempest episode about a hero being written poorly now. :D\n\nOh my god, there's so many letters!\n\nOooh, what proof of the Wraith's identity is sitting, untouched, on someone's desk? :O\n\nIt's called *Cosmic* Contest, of course it counts for space!\n\nCan't wait for the Dawn of Ra storyline to pop up.\n\n*Who* could record Setback's luck? :O Glamour? The Entertainer??\n\nI'm glad there won't be any more expansions, that would just be overwhelming to comprehend! :)",
